{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S10、S11、S12等较短段落中感受词分时出现得比较密，观众可能忙于追字，反而不如X右栏能一眼总览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮短语把每段叙事的关键转折凸显出来，人物为什么矛盾、为什么反复动摇、最后如何作出选择，都比X更容易抓住；反复出现的「被当作自己人」也把前后串成了一条清楚的情感线。感受部分则更贴合音乐当下的变化，不只是给情绪贴标签，还写出了身体反应、音乐动作和情绪转折，细腻程度明显更好。主要代价是短段落的信息出现得较密，部分观众可能来不及兼顾音乐和文字。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e522cdcb-3cf5-4f27-9cd9-39215f6c2ea3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231348461158Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.61, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:15:00.075356+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "383d792da89f8c07b392c5d951723ef79c68f30dde527b9993846a0ca2599a48", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp